<li>Register your Singapore Citizen or PR employee for a class that <strong>ends by 30 November 2026</strong>, as <strong>company-sponsored</strong>, and pay the course fee after funding.</li>
<li>Your employee attends and completes the course. We submit the attendance and assessment results to SWDA.</li>
