<h3>Redesigned SFEC from 1 December 2026</h3>
<p>Companies with at least 3 resident employees receive a fresh $10,000 in an online SFEC wallet that offsets out-of-pocket fees <strong>upfront at enrolment</strong>, instead of reimbursing them afterwards. SWDA has not yet published the support rates and claim steps; see <a href="https://www.ourworkforce.gov.sg/programmes-directory/programme/skillsfuture-enterprise-credit-enhanced"<?php echo $_ext; ?>>OurWorkforce</a> or our <a href="<?php echo $this->escapeHtml(Mage::getUrl('', array('_direct' => 'sfec.html'))); ?>">SFEC guide</a>.</p>
